  "description": "External changes are proposed to the shopfront, refurbishment of the fascia and removal of external shutters including the use tyre sales only and confirm a Class E use.\rProposed operating hours and staff numbers\r\rIt is proposed that the tyre sales operating times will be Monday to Friday 08:00-18:00\rSaturday 09:00-16:00\rSundays and Bank Holidays Closed\r\rOutside of these hours the premises will remain closed to the public\r\rWe will employ 3-4 full-time members of staff, including a sales reception assistant, with staffing levels sufficient to safely manage customers, stock, and operating during trading hours\r\rFramework Delivery and Servicing Plan\rDeliveries of tyres will typically occur two to three times per week depending on demand.\r\rDelivery vehicles will consist of standard medium-sizad panel vans.\r\r\rDelivery vehicles will enter the site via new drop kerb crossover to Mostyn Road.\rA dedicated delivery bay/yard at the rear (or designed forecourt space) will be used for loading/unloading, ensuring vehicles do not obstruc the public highway.\rVehicles will manoeuvre on site in a forward gear.\rAfter unloading, vehicles will exit site via same crossover, rejoining Mostyn Road in a forward gear.\r\r\rServicing Procedures\rDeliveries will be scheduled outside peak customers hours( typically before 9:30 and after 16:30) to minimise conflict with customers and local traffic.\rTyres will be unloaded manually by hand directly into the storage area, with no specialist equipment generating noise or vibration.\r\rThank you",
